Now take the time component: $\begin{aligned}
\partial_\mu F^{\mu t}
&=\partial_tF^{tt}
  +\partial_xF^{xt}
  +\partial_yF^{yt}
  +\partial_zF^{zt}\\
&=\partial_xE_x+\partial_yE_y+\partial_zE_z\\
&=\boldsymbol\nabla\cdot\mathbf E.\end{aligned}$ It therefore gives Equation . Performing the same checks on the dual tensor yields $\boldsymbol\nabla\cdot\mathbf B=0$ and $\boldsymbol\nabla\times\mathbf E=-\partial_t\mathbf B$.

